This product is a consolidation of the following originally-independent
Camunda BPM example/archetype repositories, forked and rebranded for
EximeeBPMS (see docs-camunda-repository-references.md in eximeebpms-factory
for the full rebrand record):

  examples/            <- camunda/camunda-bpm-examples
                          Copyright 2013-2025 Camunda Services GmbH

  archetype-templates/ <- camunda/camunda-archetypes
                          Copyright 2012-2025 Camunda Services GmbH

  archetype-samples/   <- camunda/camunda-bpm-archetype-{engine-plugin,
                          cockpit-plugin,servlet-war,ejb-war,spring-boot,
                          servlet-war-demo,spring-boot-demo}
                          Copyright Camunda Services GmbH

  assert-scenario/     <- camunda/camunda-bpm-assert-scenario
                          (internally: camunda-platform-scenario)
                          Originally developed by martin.schimak@plexiti.com
                          (http://plexiti.com/)

  mockito/             <- camunda-community-hub/camunda-platform-7-mockito
                          (originally: camunda-bpm-mockito), forked at the
                          5.15.0 tag
                          Developed by Jan Galinski and Simon Zambrovski,
                          Holisticon AG (http://holisticon.de)

  examples/businessruletask/order-confirmation-rules/
                          <- camunda/camunda-consulting,
                          one-time-examples/order-confirmation-rules
                          Copyright Camunda Services GmbH
                          Originally presented at WJAX 2011
                          (see the module's own README.md)

Each subdirectory retains its own LICENSE/NOTICE (or, for the seven
archetype-samples/ projects, a License section in its own README.md) from
its original source, per the Apache License 2.0's attribution requirements.
All content is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made: package/coordinate namespace rebranded from
org.camunda/com.camunda to org.eximeebpms/com.eximeebpms throughout;
Camunda-branded product references updated to EximeeBPMS where they refer
to this rebranded platform (external/upstream references left unchanged);
directories renamed and reorganized into the five groups above; CMMN
example content and references removed, consistent with EximeeBPMS's own
removal of CMMN support (see docs-camunda-repository-references.md in
eximeebpms-factory); mockito/'s dependency on the third-party
io.holunda.data:camunda-bpm-data library (itself compiled against the
pre-rename engine and incompatible with it) removed, along with the two
optional VariableFactory-typed convenience overloads that depended on it;
mockito/'s Fake/Mock classes extended with a handful of interface methods
(e.g. Task.hasComment/hasAttachment/getTaskState, DelegateTask.getLastUpdated,
Execution.getProcessDefinitionKey) added to the engine after the forked
5.15.0 release.
